sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Cam as Camera (exit gate)
    participant Edge as Edge Pipeline
    participant Ingest as Backend Ingest API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Bus as RabbitMQ
    participant Dash as Dashboard / Notification

    Cam->>Edge: RTSP frame stream at exit gate
    Edge->>Edge: VehicleDetected -> PlateRecognized (PaddleOCR)<br/>-> ByteTrack track_id matched to known VehicleTrack
    Edge->>Ingest: POST /api/v1/sites/{siteId}/ingest/events<br/>{eventId, occurredAt, type=VehicleExited,<br/>plate, track_id, slot_id, snapshot}
    Ingest->>Ingest: idempotency check (event_id)
    Ingest->>DB: INSERT ParkingEvent (VehicleExited) +<br/>Outbox row (same tx)
    Ingest->>DB: UPDATE ParkingSlot status=free,<br/>current_vehicle_id=null
    Ingest->>DB: UPDATE Vehicle.current_slot_id=null,<br/>last_seen_at=occurred_at
    DB-->>Ingest: committed
    Ingest->>Bus: relay publish VehicleExited (outbox)
    Bus-->>Dash: consumer pushes slot-map free +<br/>NotificationSent (optional, e.g. billing/duration)
    Ingest-->>Edge: 202 Accepted {eventId}

    Note over Cam,Dash: TARGET flow. Today (§1): edge posts to<br/>POST /api/vehicles/check-vehicle with type=exit,<br/>backend writes a VehicleLog row directly (entryExitTime,<br/>type=exit, gate FK, securityGuard, imagePath) and<br/>updates Vehicle.status=exited, broadcast via STOMP<br/>/topic/vehicle-check and /topic/gate/{gateId}/check.<br/>No slot release, no event bus, no outbox today.
